{
  "_readme": [
    "ES<->EN bridge for memory recall. The operator writes prompts in Mexican",
    "Spanish; many memories are written in English. A lexical index (TF-IDF or",
    "plain overlap) scores ZERO across that gap: 'cobro/hora' shares no token",
    "with 'rate/hourly', so the right memory stays invisible. This map expands",
    "query tokens with their counterparts in the other language before scoring.",
    "",
    "Config-first on purpose: extend this file, do not edit the script.",
    "Groups are SYMMETRIC — every term in a group expands to every other term.",
    "Keep groups tight; a loose group turns recall into noise."
  ],
